{"version":1,"content":"<p>隨着多個地區陸續強制推行網絡年齡驗證制度，不少用户為了繼續訪問社交媒體、成人網站及其他被認定可能對未成年人有害的內容，紛紛尋找繞過限制的方法。除了使用虛擬專用網絡或請成年人協助之外，最新銷售數據顯示，一部分用户正重新轉向實體光盤，成人DVD市場因此出現明顯回暖。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/movie/1587234.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-20T06:44:07.208290+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":136,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-20T06:23:04+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-20T06:37:14.515185+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-20T06:37:14.515185+00:00","content_hash":"1ff91a077c74a2b66bf7fcba595743c3e876076f104329ea33d5aba3de2be223","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}